  "motion": {
    "frames": 120,
    "note": "ours, modelled on Showdown's normal Golisopod idle (a subtle 39-frame breath) and its stance: the big claw arms hang at the sides with the claws forward and down (rest pose SH_DOWN / SH_FWD / EL_DOWN / EL_FWD, fitted to the normal form's Showdown silhouette; the model's bind pose is a T-pose). 120 frames = 3.6 s: 3 breaths (spine BREATH deg), the claw arms and the raised upper claws following a beat later (ARM, FOLLOW). Signature claw strike, frames 66-105: the claws thrust forward THRUST deg and up, the upper pincers snap open and shut (SNAP), all eased; drawn per frame (style.fast_frames)"
  },
